{"availability":"available","full":"ChanMeng666/archlang","name":"archlang","description":"An open-source DSL and compiler for floor plans: write .arch source (or have an AI agent write it) and compile it to SVG, DXF or PDF with linting and geometric validation.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":22,"forks":2,"created":"2026-06-24T14:26:42Z","updated":"2026-10-18T20:57:13Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://archlang.uk/","topics":["agentic-ai","ai-agents","architecture","cad","cli","compiler","diagrams-as-code","domain-specific-language","dsl","dxf","floor-plan","floorplan","llm","llm-tools","mcp","model-context-protocol","svg","text-to-diagram","typescript","zero-dependency"],"demo":"https://playground.archlang.uk/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T21:01:07.816Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T21:01:07.816Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T21:01:07.816Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T06:51:07.103Z","stars":13,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-05T05:50:38.096Z","stars":13,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-07T11:14:50.540Z","stars":15,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-09T13:18:37.248Z","stars":15,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-12T13:35:00.561Z","stars":17,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-18T21:01:07.816Z","stars":22,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Floor plans as code — text in, a precise architectural drawing out.","A deterministic DSL and compiler for floor plans: write (or have an LLM write) .arch source and it compiles to SVG/DXF/PDF with linting and geometric validation — diffable, version-controllable, reproducible. Open source (MIT). Zero-dependency, and built so an AI agent can verify its own plan without ever looking at an image.","[]( []( []( [](#-why-it-is-different) [](LICENSE) []( []("],"features":["It draws like an architect, not like a plotter","Poché-hatched walls (by material), door swing arcs, window glazing, computed room areas, dimension lines, layers, line weights, a north arrow, a scale bar and a title block. Real drawn symbols for every catalogued…","It checks architectural soundness, not just syntax","arch lint encodes tacit professional knowledge: a bathroom reachable only through a bedroom, a wet room that isn't fully walled in, a door whose swing hits furniture or another door, a windowless bedroom, an unenterable…","It models how a person actually walks the plan"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ChanMeng666/archlang/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"144755c8dc0d08f3222a09da199a93792725aec71f24672683e12fda76899fa3","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T23:12:50.606Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T23:12:50.606Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Floor plans as code — text in, a precise architectural drawing out.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ChanMeng666/archlang/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"144755c8dc0d08f3222a09da199a93792725aec71f24672683e12fda76899fa3","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ChanMeng666/archlang/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T23:12:50.609Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T13:17:24Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ChanMeng666/archlang/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T23:12:50.612Z","hash":"144755c8dc0d08f3222a09da199a93792725aec71f24672683e12fda76899fa3","originalBytes":125915,"storedBytes":125915,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:12:01.380Z","qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T18:12:25.924Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v1.39.0","tag":"v1.39.0","publishedAt":"2026-10-02T22:00:40Z","url":"https://github.com/ChanMeng666/archlang/releases/tag/v1.39.0"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T18:12:25.924Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/f1cc828fcc257aa9684abd0c.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-18T21:24:00.382Z","url":"https://playground.archlang.uk/"}],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T23:12:44.405Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://playground.archla